+## Authentication
+
 Tokens are configured in `API_TOKENS`, a mapping from user name to token.
-Every request need `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
+Every request needs `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; a missing or unknown
+token gets a 401. Items are always scoped to the token's user, so another
+user's item answers 404 rather than 403.
+
+For local development, pass the mapping when creating the app:
+
+    from todo_api import create_app
+    app = create_app({"API_TOKENS": {"dev": "dev-token"}})
+
+## Examples
+
+    curl -H "Authorization: Bearer dev-token" localhost:5000/todos
+    curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer dev-token" \
+         -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+         -d '{"title": "Buy milk"}' localhost:5000/todos
 
